architecture "Components and relationships"
direction left-to-right
node User role=input tag=INPUT
node Gateway role=backend tag=API sublabel="Validate requests"
node Queue role=default tag=EVENTS
node Database role=store tag=DATA
node Partner role=external tag=REMOTE
node Cache role=optional tag=CACHE
User -> Gateway: HTTPS
Gateway => Database: commit
Gateway ~> Queue: publish
Queue -> Partner: deliver
Gateway -> Cache: lookup
group Platform: Gateway, Database, Queue, Cache
highlight Gateway
